    "sourceLicense": "CC BY 4.0",
    "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
    "attribution": "Hong Kong Cantonese Corpus (HKCanCor), created by Luke Kang Kwong. Cite K. K. Luke and May L. Y. Wong (2015), The Hong Kong Cantonese Corpus: Design and Uses. Editorial titles and approximate sentence timings added by Leafbound.",
    "timing": "estimated",
    "transcript": [
      {
        "at": 0,
        "label": "01",
        "text": "A：我唔係講笑。嗱，尋日呢，我就去哩個GV旺角哩個新嘅商場嗰個戲院就睇戲。就睇哩個叫做《因愛之名》。五點半。我包咗佢吖。你有冇試過睇戲，喺個片頭出嘞，開場，我企起身啊！「各位，隨便。隨便。吓，大家，不成敬意。隨便。」",
        "jyutping": "ngo5 m4hai6 gong2siu3 naa4 cam4jat6 ne1 ngo5 zau6 heoi3 ni1go3 GV0 wong6gok3 ni1go3 san1 ge3 soeng1coeng4 go2go3 hei3jyun2 zau6 tai2hei3 zau6 tai2 ni1go3 giu3zou6 jan1 ngoi3 zi1 ming4 m5dim2bun3 ngo5 baau1 zo2 keoi5 aa1 nei5 jau5mou5 si3gwo3 tai2hei3 hai2 go3 pin2tau4 ceot1 laak3 hoi1coeng4 ngo5 kei5hei2san1 aa3 gok3wai2 ceoi4pin2 ceoi4pin2 haa6 daai6gaa1 bat1sing4ging3ji3 ceoi4pin2",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 18,
        "label": "02",
        "text": "B：環顧四周。",
        "jyutping": "waan4gu3 sei3zau1",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 19,
        "label": "03",
        "text": "A：即係可以噉樣大聲講吓嘢。然後睇到鍾意嘅地方，「好！繼續！」噉樣。舉晒手。你得唔得？",
        "jyutping": "zik1hai6 ho2ji5 gam2joeng2 daai6seng1 gong2 haa5 je5 jin4hau6 tai2dou3 zung1ji3 ge3 dei6fong1 hou2 gai3zuk6 gam2joeng2 geoi2 saai3 sau2 nei5 dak1 m4 dak1",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 26,
        "label": "04",
        "text": "B：「唔該wind帶。」噉𡃉，係嗎？",
        "jyutping": "m4goi1 wind0 daai2 gam2 gaa3 hai6 maa3",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 29,
        "label": "05",
        "text": "A：哩啲冇。哩個唔得。",
        "jyutping": "ni1di1 mou5 ni1go3 m4 dak1",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 31,
        "label": "06",
        "text": "B：但係就有兩個係嗰啲叫做帶位員呢，係招呼你兩位。專誠招呼你兩位啫。",
        "jyutping": "daan6hai6 zau6 jau5 loeng5 go3 hai6 go2di1 giu3zou6 daai3wai2jyun4 ne1 hai6 ziu1fu1 nei5 loeng5 wai2 zyun1sing4 ziu1fu1 nei5 loeng5 wai2 ze1",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 36,
        "label": "07",
        "text": "A：真係啊。而事實上，一開場之前，嗰兩位帶位員有位入咗來。「咦咿！得兩個人咋喎。」然後，我即刻拎轉頭同佢講，「兩個人都放片𡃉，係嗎？」「哦，放！放放！」唔係好似搭van仔噉，使唔使等夠一個-",
        "jyutping": "zan1hai6 aa3 ji4 si6sat6soeng6 jat1 hoi1coeng4 zi1cin4 go2 loeng5 wai2 daai3wai2 jyun4 jau5 wai2 jap6 zo2 lai4 ji4 ji2 dak1 loeng5 go3 jan4 zaa3 wo3 jin4hau6 ngo5 zik1haak1 ling6zyun3tau4 tung4 keoi5 gong2 loeng5 go3 jan4 dou1 fong3 pin2 gaa3 hai6 maa3 o5 fong3 fong3 fong3 m4hai6 hou2ci5 daap3 van0 zai2 gam2 sai2 m4sai2 deng2 gau3 jat1 go3",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 53,
        "label": "08",
        "text": "B：要啊。",
        "jyutping": "jiu3 aa3",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 53,
        "label": "09",
        "text": "C：「起碼都等夠十個人，我哋先放𡃉，大佬。」",
        "jyutping": "hei2maa5 dou1 deng2 gau3 sap6 go3 jan4 ngo5dei6 sin1 fong3 gaa3 daai6lou2",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 57,
        "label": "10",
        "text": "B：要九點半度嚹。",
        "jyutping": "jiu3 gau2dim2bun3 dou2 laa3",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 58,
        "label": "11",
        "text": "A：喂，我幾驚佢話，「喂，阿哩兩位呀，你哋可唔可以過去隔離嗰間睇吖？等我哋休息一陣。」",
        "jyutping": "wai3 ngo5 gei2 geng1 keoi5 waa6 wai3 aa6 ni1 loeng5 wai2 aa4 nei5dei6 ho2 m4 ho2ji5 gwo3heoi3 gaak3lei4 go2 gaan1 tai2 aa1 deng2 ngo5dei6 jau1sik1 jat1zan6",
        "terms": []
      }
    ]
