    "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
    "attribution": "00151p:《我隻狗仔係唔同啲嘅！》The Puppy and the Kitten\n \nThe CC BY 4.0 license REQUIRES that any reused or repurposed content must have the correct ATTRIBUTION. Please use the text below in your citations, printouts and copyright pages.\n \nAttribution Text \n\n\n\"The Puppy and The Kitten\" (Cantonese), translated by HamBaangLaang (© HamBaangLaang, 2020) from Tommy and Tingu (English), written by Kanchan Bannerjee, illustrated by Natasha Mehra, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2013) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in\n \n[Find out more here: HamBaangLaang Attribution terms and CC 4.0]\n________________",
    "timing": "untimed",
