    "attribution": "00121p:《跳上太空》Jump into Space\n \nThe CC BY 4.0 license REQUIRES that any reused or repurposed content must have the correct ATTRIBUTION. Please use the text below in your citations, printouts and copyright pages.\n \nAttribution Text \n\n\n\"Jump into Space\" (Cantonese), translated by HamBaangLaang (© HamBaangLaang, 2020) based on the original story Springloaded (English), written by Chenél Ferreira, Sam Wilson, illustrated by Thea Nicole de Klerk, published by Book Dash (© Book Dash, 2016) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in\n \n[Find out more here: HamBaangLaang Attribution terms and CC 4.0]\n________________",
    "timing": "untimed",
    "transcript": [
      {
        "at": 0,
        "label": "1",
        "text": "有時我望住個天空，就會好想飛。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 4,
        "label": "2",
        "text": "於是我同爸爸講：「如果有啲嘢可以令人好方便噉飛就好喇！」",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 11,
        "label": "3",
        "text": "爸爸整咗件新發明出嚟：「睇下，係竹蜻蜓啊！將佢戴喺頭上面，就可以飛上天空㗎喇！」",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 22,
        "label": "4",
        "text": "爸爸戴住佢飛咗上天空。我望住爸爸越飛越高，同佢講拜拜。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 29,
        "label": "5",
        "text": "爸爸都同我講拜拜，佢笑住噉飛走咗。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 33,
        "label": "6",
        "text": "爸爸冇整第二隻竹蜻蜓畀我，我冇得飛。]我覺得好悶。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 40,
        "label": "7",
        "text": "我問貓仔：「你想唔想上天空玩啊？」 貓仔話：「想啊！不如你都發明啲嘢上天空吖！」",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 50,
        "label": "8",
        "text": "我返入屋。枱上面仲有好多嘢。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 54,
        "label": "9",
        "text": "「就等我發明啲嘢出嚟啦。」我噉樣諗。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 59,
        "label": "10",
        "text": "得咗喇！呢對係識得跳上天空嘅鞋！",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 63,
        "label": "11",
        "text": "我着住佢，輕輕一跳，就跳到好高喇。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 67,
        "label": "12",
        "text": "我走出街，喺街上面跳嚟跳去。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 71,
        "label": "13",
        "text": "我好似超人噉啊！",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 73,
        "label": "14",
        "text": "我跳上天空。雀仔見到我都覺得驚！",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 77,
        "label": "15",
        "text": "我跳出天空，跳上太空。太空好黑啊！",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 82,
        "label": "16",
        "text": "不過太空太高喇！我跌緊落去啊！",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 86,
        "label": "17",
        "text": "我跌返落去天空度。爸爸見到我跌落嚟。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 90,
        "label": "18",
        "text": "佢用兩隻手接住我。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 93,
        "label": "19",
        "text": "落返嚟之後，爸爸改良咗我對鞋。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 97,
        "label": "20",
        "text": "而家，我、爸爸同貓仔都可以跳上太空玩喇！",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      }
    ]
