    "attribution": "00138p:《奇幻旅程》My Aunt and I\n \nThe CC BY 4.0 license REQUIRES that any reused or repurposed content must have the correct ATTRIBUTION. Please use the text below in your citations, printouts and copyright pages.\n \nAttribution Text \n\n\n\"My Aunt and I\" (Cantonese), translated by HamBaangLaang (© HamBaangLaang, 2020) from Pishi and Me (English), written by Timira Gupta, illustrated by Rajiv Eipe, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books,2018) under a CC BY 4.0 license, first released on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in\n\n\n[Find out more here: HamBaangLaang Attribution terms and CC 4.0]\n________________",
    "timing": "untimed",
    "transcript": [
      {
        "at": 0,
        "label": "2",
        "text": "我好鍾意同阿魚去街，今日同佢去街有好多嘢發生。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 6,
        "label": "3",
        "text": "我成日都會覺得啲花花草草會同我拍手。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 11,
        "label": "4",
        "text": "我哋慢慢噉行，有件得人驚嘅事發生咗。有隻狗仔望住我，佢同我講：「前面會有我嘅朋友，你見到可以同佢哋玩下。」",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 25,
        "label": "5",
        "text": "我以為聽錯咗，行多幾步，點知真係有貓、老鼠、雀仔同樹同我玩。我好開心，終於可以同動物傾計喇。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 37,
        "label": "6",
        "text": "突然我見到有粒石頭。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 39,
        "label": "7",
        "text": "原來啲石頭都識講嘢，佢哋好凍，所以我將佢哋放喺褲袋。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 46,
        "label": "8",
        "text": "我行咗一陣，原來我將好多嘢都放左落褲袋。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 52,
        "label": "9",
        "text": "行過阿十屋企，佢送咗啲豆畀我，拎返屋企食。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 57,
        "label": "10a",
        "text": "嚟到阿八間舖頭，佢就送我一個夾仔，聽講係會自己識跳嚟跳去。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 65,
        "label": "11",
        "text": "去到阿六屋企，佢就送咗張貼紙，想我靜靜噉坐喺度等阿魚。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 72,
        "label": "12",
        "text": "跟住見到阿大，佢送咗粒扣，原來喺粒糖。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 77,
        "label": "13",
        "text": "我返到屋企將全部嘢都放喺個盒度。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 81,
        "label": "14",
        "text": "最後，我送咗一粒心型石頭俾阿魚。唔知阿魚聽唔聽到佢講乜嘢呢？",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      }
    ]
