    "attribution": "00142p:《神秘的魔法石》Magic Block\n \nThe CC BY 4.0 license REQUIRES that any reused or repurposed content must have the correct ATTRIBUTION. Please use the text below in your citations, printouts and copyright pages.\n \nAttribution Text \n\n\n\"Magic Block\" (Cantonese), translated by HamBaangLaang (© HamBaangLaang, 2020) from The Magic Block (English), written by Lavina Mahbubani, illustrated by Rohit Karandadi, supported by Oracle, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2018) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in\n \n[Find out more here: HamBaangLaang Attribution terms and CC 4.0]\n________________",
    "timing": "untimed",
    "transcript": [
      {
        "at": 0,
        "label": "1",
        "text": "「我係阿魚，我好鍾意睇阿哥寫字，寫得好靚。」",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 6,
        "label": "2",
        "text": "有一日，阿哥出咗街，所以阿魚就靜雞雞噉拎阿哥支筆嚟寫字。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 13,
        "label": "3",
        "text": "阿魚揾到好多嘢，咩都有，有間尺啦、紙啦同釘書機啦。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 20,
        "label": "4",
        "text": "阿魚揾到一個特別嘅石頭，原來呢個石頭係有魔法架。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 26,
        "label": "5",
        "text": "突然，石頭吸咗支鐵棒過嚟。 「啊！唔知佢吸唔吸到其他嘢呢？等我試下先。」",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 36,
        "label": "6",
        "text": "當佢拎住魔法石頭行埋去釘書機嗰陣，釘書機突然走埋嚟，阿魚嚇親。 當佢拎魔法石頭去吸貓仔，貓仔冇理佢。 「點解吸唔到嘅？」",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 51,
        "label": "7",
        "text": "當佢試下吸住鐵嘅間尺時，間尺企咗起身。 阿魚好開心，想再試其他嘢。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 60,
        "label": "8",
        "text": "當佢吸椰子嗰陣，又唔得喇。 阿魚好想知點解會噉。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 66,
        "label": "9",
        "text": "突然，「叮」一聲，原來阿哥返咗屋企。 阿魚驚到跳咗起身、整跌晒啲嘢。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 75,
        "label": "10",
        "text": "阿魚好唔開心，阿哥最鍾意嗰支筆跌咗喺床下，佢要諗辦法執返起佢。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 84,
        "label": "11",
        "text": "佢想用間尺攞支筆返嚟，點知推得仲遠。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 88,
        "label": "12",
        "text": "「叮」，呢次唔係又有人返到屋企，而係阿魚有辦法喇！",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 95,
        "label": "13",
        "text": "佢用魔法石頭吸住間尺，再等魔法石頭吸住支筆。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 101,
        "label": "14",
        "text": "得咗！終於得咗喇！",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 103,
        "label": "15",
        "text": "阿魚要等阿哥未注意嗰陣，將啲嘢放返好。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 108,
        "label": "16",
        "text": "阿哥一返到嚟，淨係見到有個椰子。 阿魚仲係好想知，嗰個魔法石頭係咩嚟，你哋知唔知係咩嚟啊？",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      }
    ]
