    "attribution": "00247p:《失控嘅雀仔》The Bird Out of Control\n\n\nThe CC BY 4.0 license REQUIRES that any content that is reused or repurposed must have the correct ATTRIBUTION. Please use the text below in your citations, printouts and copyright pages.\n\n\nAttribution Text:\n\n\n\"The Bird Out of Control” (Cantonese), translated by HamBaangLaang (© HamBaangLaang, 2022), is based on the original story, Kaakaasaurus (English), written by Shalini Srinivasan, illustrated by Prabha Mallya, supported by Oracle, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2017) under a CC BY 4. license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in\n\n\n[Find out more here: HamBaangLaang Attribution terms and CC 4.0]\n________________",
    "timing": "untimed",
