    "attribution": "00208:《八號》Number 8\n \nThe CC BY 4.0 license REQUIRES that any content that is reused or repurposed must have the correct ATTRIBUTION. Please use the text below in your citations, printouts and copyright pages.\n \nAttribution Text: \n\n\n\"Number 8” (Cantonese), written by 黃嘉俊, illustrated by Wendy Yu, published by HamBaangLaang (© HamBaangLaang, 2022) under a CC BY 4.0 license on hambaanglaang.hk\n \n[Find out more here: HamBaangLaang Attribution terms and CC 4.0]\n________________",
    "timing": "untimed",
