    "attribution": "00200:《至like交通工具》The Most Likeable Transportation\n \nThe CC BY 4.0 license REQUIRES that any content that is reused or repurposed must have the correct ATTRIBUTION. Please use the text below in your citations, printouts and copyright pages.\n \nAttribution Text: \n\n\n\"The Most Likeable Transportation” (Cantonese), written by 餘星, illustrated by Angel, published by HamBaangLaang (© HamBaangLaang, 2022) under a CC BY 4.0 license on hambaanglaang.hk\n \n[Find out more here: HamBaangLaang Attribution terms and CC 4.0]\n________________",
